OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate dentists too expensive for
OL,4,Amillions, watchdog warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Competition watchdog says
OL,7,Fwide-ranging reforms are needed in the
OL,8,FUK's private dentistry market to ensure
OL,9,Fpeople get a fair deal.
OL,11,FIt says patients can struggle with
OL,12,Fcosts and find it difficult to shop
OL,13,Faround and compare prices.
OL,15,FAround four million people did not go
OL,16,Fto the dentist in the past two years
OL,17,Fbecause they found treatment expensive,
OL,18,Fthe watchdog estimates.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
