OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate dentists too expensive for
OL,4,Amillions, watchdog warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Dental Association says it
OL,7,Fis essential that there is a thriving
OL,8,Fprivate market but it is also vital
OL,9,Fthat the government fixes NHS
OL,10,Fdentistry.
